[en.FOCUS_C01_IMPROVE_LIVELIHOOD]
Chocolate Ration

[en.FOCUS_C01_IMPROVE_LIVELIHOOD_desc]
In addition to the macro-economic operation of the Empire, a good (or seemingly good) living condition is conducive to the stability of the Empire. Therefore, the Empire will continue to improve the living standards of ponies, such as the announcement today by the Ministry of Friendship that the chocolate quota for each pony will be increased to 20 grams.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_IMPROVE_LIVELIHOOD]
巧克力配额

[zh.FOCUS_C01_IMPROVE_LIVELIHOOD_desc]
除了帝国宏观上的经济运行以外，一个良好（或者表面上良好）的民生状况有利于帝国的稳定。因此，帝国将不断致力于提高小马们的生活水平，例如小马利亚帝国友谊部今日宣布将每只小马的巧克力配额增加至20克。

